   "text": "Edit AuthorControls. The same height creates clods, smooth puddles, normals, AO and roughness. Color has no baked highlights or shadows. Export Maps, then Reload Assets. Maps: RGB albedo / A height; normal file RG normal XY / B roughness / A AO. 512 pixels, 64 m repeat."
  },
